  "body": "**Stacked on #1522** (branched from its head f35bd14e, because #1522 changes `depth_law_of`'s Slot arm). Until #1522 merges, this PR's diff includes #1522's commits; this PR's own change is the last two commits (526fff3c, b8653f25).\n\n## What changed\n\nRoot cause: `depth_law_of` (`crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`) gave a Slot `DepthLaw::Section` only when its source was a Selection (#1522). A Slot whose source is the whole finished part (`SrcRef::Entity(\"part\")`, `part_solid` true) fell to `_ => DepthLaw::None`, so a typed slot through the part's wall generated and posted with no gouge warning.\n\nFix: every Slot takes `DepthLaw::Section` when `part_solid` holds (picked or whole model). A Stock source, or an entity that is the stock, is not part-solid (`part_solid_of`), so it is still cut unjudged. No existing law weakened; the pocket-family Selection arm is unchanged. Decision record: `docs/decisions/1537-slot-entity-law.md`.\n\nCircular has the same gap; left out to keep this P1 minimal, filed as #1543.\n\n## Changed pin\n\n`with_nothing_picked_the_typed_endpoints_rule_as_before` (`crates/app/tests/slot_picks.rs`) asserted that an Entity(\"part\") slot through the pocket wall gets **no** Gouge. That was the unsafe behaviour #1537 reports (#1504's maintainer expectation: \"the model gouge check still decides\"). It now covers only the Stock source (still cut as typed, unjudged); the Entity case moved to the new test below.\n\n## How tested\n\n- New pinning test `a_whole_part_slot_through_the_wall_is_convicted_and_holds_the_post`: Entity(\"part\") slot (-20,0)-(20,0) w12 through the 30x16 pocket's walls -> blocking `Warning::Gouge`; plus an Entity(\"part\") slot inside the pocket verifies clean (over-conviction guard).\n- Mutation check: deleting the line `OpParams::Slot { .. } => DepthLaw::Section,` -> the new test RED (and #1522's `a_slot_through_the_pocket_wall_is_refused_and_one_below_the_floor_holds_the_post` RED, since the arm now carries the picked case too); restored -> 8/8 GREEN.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green (motion 337 s, app 1189 s, ui 208 s; 0 failed). `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -D warnings`: clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nReal-world whole-model slot projects beyond the test fixture; Circular (#1543).\n\nChangelog: A Slot on the whole finished part is checked against it: a slot typed through the part's wall is a blocking gouge.\n\nEffort: high (no escalation)\n\nfork synced at v0.19.0\n\nFixes #1537\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
